      "message": "rpc: refuse to overwrite files in exportasmap\n\nWith `-asmap=asmap.dat`, running `exportasmap asmap.dat` replaces the configured map on disk with the embedded one.\nThe running node keeps using the custom map until its next restart.\n\nThe RPC originally allowed overwrites because another export from the same binary is cheap and produces the same bytes.\nRequire a new destination to protect files the binary cannot regenerate. Callers that refresh an export at a fixed path must first move or remove the previous file.",
