      ],
      "message": "test: characterize ASMap groups and bucket restoration\n\nMapped AS numbers currently share the IPv6 group tag.\nLoad the same saved peer with the version an ASMap node currently stores and with the raw ASMap hash, which are the same for now.\nIts saved position was computed without ASMap, so rebucketing it with ASMap would move it to a different bucket.",
