      "message": "net: give ASMap address groups a distinct tag\n\nAn AS number and the /32 prefix of an IPv6 address outside the map can encode the same group.\nReserve a tag outside the network classes for AS numbers.\n\nChange the bucketing version in `peers.dat` so upgrades and downgrades recalculate bucket placement for nodes using ASMap.\nNodes without ASMap keep the null bucketing version and reuse their saved buckets.\nThe `asmap_version` reported by `getnetworkinfo` still identifies the map itself.",
